OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in car and motorcycle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 50s has died following a
OL,7,Fcollision between a car and a
OL,8,Fmotorcycle.
OL,10,FKent Police said a grey Nissan Qashqai
OL,11,Fwas being driven on the A28 in
OL,12,FRolvenden towards Hastings when it
OL,13,Fcrashed with a silver Honda CB500
OL,14,Fmotorcycle at about 11:50 BST on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FThe force said the Honda, which was
OL,18,Ftravelling in the opposite direction,
OL,19,Fhad been in convoy with two other
OL,20,Fmotorcycles.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
